      "summary": "Global 10 m land cover classification derived from Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2, cloud-optimised.",
      "description": "Eleven-class land cover at 10 m resolution, global, published as cloud-optimised GeoTIFFs. The primary siting exclusion layer for renewable development at continental scale, and a strong partial-read exemplar: a siting study needs one tile, not the planet.",
